# Changed 2026-08-20 from ODC-By-1.0 on the authors' decision. All three Hugging
# Face datasets already advertised cc-by-4.0, so this file was the outlier and the
# one a data-availability statement points at. CC-BY-4.0 has covered sui generis
# database rights since 4.0, so it is a defensible dataset licence, and aligning to
# it re-licenses nothing that was already published.
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - flood traversability
  - Gaussian splatting
  - material point method
  - world models
  - autonomous vehicles
repository-code: "https://github.com/jcerrell-IS/can-it-ford"
